1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,395
Speaking, task one. Topic 17: Weather and seasons. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer aloud.

2
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,635
What's the weather like today?

3
00:00:18,033 --> 00:00:21,204
Today it's cold and raining, about five degrees.

4
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,352
Which season do you like best?

5
00:00:29,767 --> 00:00:33,051
I like summer best because it's warm and the days are long.

6
00:00:33,967 --> 00:00:35,364
What do you do when it rains?

7
00:00:40,767 --> 00:00:44,462
When it rains I stay at home, read or watch a film.

8
00:00:45,367 --> 00:00:47,291
What's the weather like in the Czech Republic in winter?

9
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:55,901
In winter it's cold in the Czech Republic, sometimes it snows and freezes.

10
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,975
What's the weather like in your country in summer?

11
00:01:04,367 --> 00:01:07,664
In my country it's very hot in summer, up to thirty-five degrees.

12
00:01:08,567 --> 00:01:10,565
Do you watch the weather forecast?

13
00:01:15,967 --> 00:01:18,988
Yes, I check the forecast on my phone every morning.

14
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,888
What was the weather like last weekend?

15
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:30,171
Last weekend it was lovely, the sun was shining.

16
00:01:31,067 --> 00:01:32,676
What did you do last winter?

17
00:01:38,067 --> 00:01:41,510
Last winter we went sledging and built a snowman.

18
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,061
What will the weather be like tomorrow?

19
00:01:49,467 --> 00:01:52,225
According to the forecast it will be sunny and warm tomorrow.

20
00:01:53,133 --> 00:01:55,088
Where would you like to live because of the weather?

21
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:03,608
Because of the weather I'd like to live by the sea, where it's warm.

22
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:14,895
Great! Practise topic 17 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
